# Cloudflare Pages' default for every file is `max-age=0, must-revalidate`, so every
# page open revalidated the JS, the CSS and the font: two-three 304 round trips,
# measured at 22 ms in-browser (57-67 ms via curl) from Cyprus on 30 Aug 2026 —
# docs/PERF-MEASUREMENT-2026-08-30.md. Everything under /assets/ is content-hashed by
# Vite, so a year + immutable is safe: a changed file is a new URL, never a stale hit.
#
# /images/ and the other public/ files are NOT hashed. Do not add them here.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
